            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esawu ŵatite, “Keleka kaŵili kunyenga une jwalakweju. Ngangusimonga kuti lina lyakwe lili Yakobo, pakuŵa anjiŵile kaŵili. Pandanda ŵasumwile ukulungwa wangu ŵakutanda kupagwa, nipo lelo asumwile upile wangu. Ana upilewo nganasunjila amta panandi baba?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
