          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaki ŵajanjile kuti, “Napele kala upile apwenuwo, nipo naŵisile kuŵa ŵakumlamulila m'mwejo. Acalongo acimjakwe ŵane wosope naŵisile kuŵa ŵakutumicila ŵakwe. Nampele soni upile wakuti agowoleje yakulya yejinji ni yakumwa yakwe. Myoyo pangali cakuti mpaka namtendele m'mwejo mwanangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
