        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Esawu ŵaŵengene najo Yakobo ligongo m'malo mwa kumpa upile jwalakwejo, Isaki ŵampele Yakobo upile. Nipo Esawu ŵaganisisye kuti, “Ndaŵi jakuwa baba ŵangu jisigele panandi, nipo timjimwulaga Yakobo.”",
